<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria conglomerate UAC 9-mth profit down.</title>
<headline>Nigeria conglomerate UAC 9-mth profit down.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month result for UAC of Nigeria Plc to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>					 1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover			8,000	6,400</p>
<p>    Profit before taxation    711.1	785.6</p>
<p>    Taxation			227.5	290.7</p>
<p>    Profit after taxation     483.6	494.9</p>
<p>    Minority interest	     141	109.4</p>
<p>Profit after taxation</p>
<p>     and minority interest    342.6	385.5</p>
<p>NOTE- The company said the result for the last quarter would be better despite a continuing harsh economic environment. ($1= 80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
